WEBVTT

NOTE
The gate confrontation — a figure advances toward Sorceress Edea.
Duration: approximately 29 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Squall leaps through the iron railings, landing behind the massive throne.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The camera slowly moves toward the throne

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Edea is revealed, with Seifer Almasy kneeling beside her like a sworn knight.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Close-up of Seifer Almasy as he grins.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Close-up of Edea, her expression cold and stern.